-- Section 2 prints three ranges; the second, 132 to 258, holds both numbers cited above. The crop shows footnote marks after the year in sections 1 and 3, which are not typed.
`range: regulations 1 to 131(ב) cancelled, KT 8085 p. 470` MEANS
    `A range of regulation numbers` WITH
        `the range as the cancelling words print it` IS "1 to 131(ב)"
        `the first number of the range` IS 1
        `the last number of the range` IS 131
        `the regulation that prints the range` IS "regulation 2 of the amending regulations in KT 8085 (11 October 2018), printed page 470; the range ends at subregulation (ב) of 131, and the row compares only whole numbers"
        `the range was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

`range: regulations 132 to 258 cancelled, KT 8085 p. 470` MEANS
