        `the last number of the range` IS 532
        `the regulation that prints the range` IS "regulation 2 of the amending regulations in KT 8085 (11 October 2018), printed page 470"
        `the range was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

`the ranges that regulation 2 cancels` MEANS
    LIST `range: regulations 1 to 131(ב) cancelled, KT 8085 p. 470`, `range: regulations 132 to 258 cancelled, KT 8085 p. 470`, `range: regulations 360 to 532 cancelled, KT 8085 p. 470`

