-- The saving clause is section 3 above: the earlier regulations continue for proceedings opened before the commencement day of the new regulations, unless the new regulations apply to those proceedings under their regulation 180(ג).
`saving clause: section 3 of the amending regulations, KT 8085 p. 470` MEANS
    `A saving clause` WITH
        `the regulation that prints the saving clause` IS "regulation 3 of the amending regulations in KT 8085 (11 October 2018), printed page 470"
        `the earlier regulations continue for proceedings opened before the commencement day` IS TRUE
        `the continuation is qualified by a rule of the new regulations on which proceedings they apply to` IS TRUE
        `the saving clause was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

