-- The amount printed at the left end of the row of item 36 is 36. The crop holds no column heading, so the row states the number and no unit. The notice's date line is the signature date of the notice (a Hebrew date and a Gregorian date, which agree by the routine).
-- The row records the order of the dates and what each page prints. It confines itself to 12 January to 20 July 2021 and says nothing about whether any registry charged the fee, who gains, or what happened to the 2017 regulations before or after that period; the suspension prints no first day for the period, and the row takes the day it was published, as its confinement.
`item 36 as the 2021 notice prints it, KT 9099 p. 1565` MEANS
    `An item printed in a notice` WITH
        `the item number` IS 36
        `the amount printed beside the item` IS 36
        `the notice was signed on` IS Date 21 12 2020
        `the notice was published on` IS Date 17 1 2021
        `the item is the item that regulation 4(3) of the 2017 temporary regulations adds` IS TRUE
        `the item row was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

`suspension: KT 9089 p. 1524` MEANS
    `A suspension` WITH
        `the instrument` IS "the regulations in KT 9089 (12 January 2021), printed page 1524"
        `the suspension was signed on` IS Date 11 1 2021
        `the suspension was published on` IS Date 12 1 2021
        `the last day of the period` IS Date 20 7 2021
        `the first day the row takes for the period` IS Date 12 1 2021
        `regulation 1 of the 2017 temporary regulations is treated as cancelled` IS TRUE
        `paragraph (3) of regulation 4 of the 2017 temporary regulations is treated as cancelled` IS TRUE
        `the suspension was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

§ `Rules and tests used by the records`

GIVEN c IS A `A cited rule`
      r IS A `A range of regulation numbers`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the rule cited lies inside the range` MEANS
    (c's `the base number of the rule` AT LEAST r's `the first number of the range`)
    AND (r's `the last number of the range` AT LEAST c's `the base number of the rule`)

GIVEN c IS A `A cited rule`
      rs IS A LIST OF `A range of regulation numbers`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`how many of the ranges hold the rule cited` MEANS
    count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD `the rule cited lies inside the range` c r) rs)

GIVEN c IS A `A cited rule`
      rs IS A LIST OF `A range of regulation numbers`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the rule cited lies inside one of the ranges` MEANS
    `how many of the ranges hold the rule cited` c rs AT LEAST 1

GIVEN c IS A `A cited rule`
      rs IS A LIST OF `A range of regulation numbers`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the rule cited lies outside every one of the ranges` MEANS NOT `the rule cited lies inside one of the ranges` c rs

GIVEN c IS A `A power citation`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`how many subsections the consolidation prints under the label the citing words give` MEANS
    count (filter (GIVEN label YIELD label EQUALS (c's `the subsection cited, as written`)) (c's `the subsection labels the consolidation prints in the section`))

GIVEN c IS A `A power citation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the consolidation prints a subsection under the label the citing words give` MEANS
    `how many subsections the consolidation prints under the label the citing words give` c AT LEAST 1

GIVEN c IS A `A power citation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the citation resolves to what the consolidation prints` MEANS
    c's `the section is printed by the consolidation`
    AND ((NOT c's `the citing words give a subsection`) OR `the consolidation prints a subsection under the label the citing words give` c)

GIVEN a IS A `A threshold printed in an item`
      b IS A `A threshold printed in an item`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the two items print the same figure` MEANS
    a's `the figure printed beside the word that opens the threshold` EQUALS b's `the figure printed beside the word that opens the threshold`

GIVEN a IS A `A threshold printed in an item`
      b IS A `A threshold printed in an item`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the difference between the two figures` MEANS
    b's `the figure printed beside the word that opens the threshold` MINUS a's `the figure printed beside the word that opens the threshold`

GIVEN n IS A `An item printed in a notice`
      s IS A `A suspension`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the item is treated as cancelled on the day the notice was published` MEANS
    n's `the item is the item that regulation 4(3) of the 2017 temporary regulations adds`
    AND s's `paragraph (3) of regulation 4 of the 2017 temporary regulations is treated as cancelled`
    AND (n's `the notice was published on` AT LEAST s's `the first day the row takes for the period`)
    AND (s's `the last day of the period` AT LEAST n's `the notice was published on`)

GIVEN n IS A `An item printed in a notice`
      s IS A `A suspension`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the notice prints no amount for an item treated as cancelled on its publication day` MEANS
    NOT (`the item is treated as cancelled on the day the notice was published` n s
         AND (n's `the amount printed beside the item` AT LEAST 1))

GIVEN n IS A `An item printed in a notice`
      s IS A `A suspension`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the notice was signed before the suspension was signed` MEANS
    n's `the notice was signed on` AT MOST s's `the suspension was signed on`
